TASK-290 runtime harness: the site-search chip's color. Temporary code, never
committed to Detour/. Apply, build, run with DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR and an isolated
DETOUR_DATA_DIR, capture the "SHOOT <windowNumber> <tag>" lines with
`screencapture -x -o -l`, then `git apply -R` it and `xcodegen generate`.

Seeds a visit to youtube.com with YouTube's real favicon URL, enters "yt " in
a Cmd+T palette (the chip is the space's blue at once, then YouTube's red once
the icon loads, white text), then in dark mode "gh " (GitHub never visited:
the space's blue stays, nothing is fetched).

Results (2026-11-07): yt → fill (0.00 0.48 1.00) then (1.00 0.00 0.00), text
white; gh → (0.00 0.48 1.00) throughout.

